--- !u!114 &857415476
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 857415474}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7407b27ab1c342438d3cfa8d788a9c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VoiceManager
  _voiceInYourHeadText: {fileID: 1132434285}
  _generalNegativeLines: []
  _quitOneSidedNegativeLines:
  - Why did I let them get that far? the little bot's heartbroken now.
  - Poor robot wasn't built to handle rejection. Why didn't I do anything?!
  - Why was I just sitting there? I should've done something!
  - I have got to act faster!
  _quitTwoSidedNegativeLines:
  - Am I blind they were perfect for each other! I should've matched them!
  - What was I waiting for? I should've decided quicker!
  _quitPositiveLines:
  - 'They were obviously terrible together! I was too late! '
  - 'I should''ve seen that coming! I''m so slow today. '
  - They both hate each other why didn't I call it early!
  _rejectTwoSidedNegativeLines:
  - Oh no they were totally in love, how could I?
  - I'm a monster! they loved each other!
  - I just got in the way of true love...
  - They were a perfect match and I ruined it!
  - They were so good for each other why didI do that?!
  _rejectOneSidedNegativeLines:
  - One of them had feelings! maybe they could've worked it out!
  - Poor bot was in love, while the other didn't feel the same, a shame really.
  - Why didn't I wait? they were getting somewhere!
  _rejectPositiveLines:
  - Ok that was a good call they both weren't feeling it much.
  - Nice! I'm finally doing something right.
  - They really dont like each other don't they?
  - Phew! Thankfully that was the right move.
  _matchOneSidedNegativeLines:
  - 'Nice, I just created an abusive relationship. '
  - That was clearly one-sided! Never a good idea.
  - One of them hates, and one of them loves. Interesting but definetly not healthy.
  - What was I thinking! The other one clearly isn't enjoying this at all.
  _matchOneSidedPositiveLines:
  - It seemed like one of them was a little more eager but they could've work it
    out!
  - Feelings were not mutual, but they were definetly getting somewhere. I should've
    kept them on!
  - At least one of them's in love, maybe if they talked a bit longer they could've
    been perfect.
  _matchTwoSidedNegativeLines:
  - Why'd I do that?! You know they both hate eachother!
  - That was a horrendous decision. I have to do better.
  - There was zero connection at all! What was I thinking.
  - I shouldn't have done that at all!
  - That was bad... I'm gonna need therapy after this.
  _matchPositiveLines:
  - Finally doing some proper matchmaking!
  - 'I think I''m getting the hang of this! '
  - Yes! I knew they were perfect.
